{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939420/extras/1_TOP.png?t=1744358451\" /><br>In Battimals players will use the DNA of an array of animals to build up a team of four unique battle animals, known as Battimals. These Battimal will compete head to head against other players\u2019 Battimals in online matches, where only one team can be victorious.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939420/extras/2.gif?t=1744358451\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939420/extras/3.png?t=1744358451\" /><br>Through the blending of each new animal\u2019s DNA, the player\u2019s Battimals will transform, taking on a percentage of the appearance of each animal added, as well as that particular animal\u2019s stats.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939420/extras/4.png?t=1744358451\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939420/extras/5.png?t=1744358451\" /><br>Compete in 8-player online matches consisting of multiple rounds. Match up with opponents through online matchmaking, or create your own lobby and invite your friends.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939420/extras/6.png?t=1744358451\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939420/extras/7.png?t=1744358451\" /><br>Rely not only on the Battimals blended stats to get the edge but also on a multitude of available upgrades that boost those stats. As well as choosing the strategic battle positioning for each Battimal allowing for a more defensive or evasive play.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939420/extras/8.pn